<title>USA: Cowen &amp; Co names James Ramp director in cap mkts.</title>
<headline>Cowen &amp; Co names James Ramp director in cap mkts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said Tuesday it named James Ramp as a director in its Capital Markets group.</p>
<p>Ramp will concentrate on public equity underwriting.</p>
<p>Ramp had been an executive vice president and director of syndicate with Gerard Klauer Mattison &amp; Co, according to a Cowen release.</p>
